@startuml
title Weather Station State Transition Diagram

[*] --> Shutdown : startup

state Shutdown
state Running
state ConfigurationMode
state ControlledMode

Shutdown --> Running : startup / beginOperation

Running --> ConfigurationMode : changeSettings or powerSavingRequired
ConfigurationMode --> Running : configurationCompleted

Running --> Running : clockTriggered / collectData
Running --> Running : requestSummary / prepareAndSendSummary
Running --> Running : checkStatus / transmitResult

Running --> ControlledMode : remoteControlCommand
Running --> Shutdown : shutdownCommand

ControlledMode --> [*] : powerOff or resetCommand

@enduml
